WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What if the thing you missed was bigger than everything you were hunting?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers asked radiologists to find tiny nodules in lung images.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
They inserted a gorilla in the last scan. Most did not report it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This was one experimental task, not an audit of clinical skills.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Attention follows instructions. No audio product was tested.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Explore the evidence. Try twelve minutes for free. Choose deliberately.
